        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "The Viet contact plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to Stored Cross-Site Scripting via admin settings in all versions up to, and including, 1.3.2 due to insufficient input sanitization and output escaping. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with administrator-level permissions and above, to inject arbitrary web scripts in pages that will execute whenever a user accesses an injected page. This only affects multi-site installations and installations where unfiltered_html has been disabled."
          }
        ],
        "title": "Viet contact <= 1.3.2 - Authenticated (Administrator+) Stored Cross-Site Scripting via 'll1', 'll2', 'll3', and 'll4' Parameters",
